re library versus shared in-crate adapter. The requested workspace.json is intentionally ignored and not checked in per structurizr/README.md, so workspace.dsl remains canonical rather than adding a generated artifact. Pinned Docker Structurizr validate passed after the final edit, all linked local source paths existed, and a fresh different-model reviewer passed with no blockers.$ !4 ^2026-09-21T20:29 %2026-09-22T23:10 #01a0c729-5de2-77cc-ad47-9ffc021e3ad3
